# E3: disparate-storage deployment experiment — planned only

These five baseline packets are planned and **not executable** in this build. They carry the same frozen Example 8 configuration as E1
(`FROZEN-EX8-v1`; agent-inputs hash identical) so the E1 reference applies unchanged. A future version will add the disparate-storage
independent variable (workspace/runtime/scratch placement) and its automation without changing the frozen Example 8 scientific problem.
No launcher exists; the manifests must remain `status: planned` until that version is approved. See `../../docs/E3_PLAN.md`.
